<title>TURKEY: Turk beet growers see 97/8 sugar output 2.05 mln T.</title>
<headline>Turk beet growers see 97/8 sugar output 2.05 mln T.</headline>
<text>
<p>The report, distributed at its general assembly in Ankara, said Turkey was expected to consume 1.95 million tonnes in 1997/98, up from 1.9 million in 1996/97.</p>
<p>The report said Turkey imported about 500,000 tonnes of sugar in calendar 1996, up from 400,000 tonnes a year earlier, but addd that Pankobirlik expected no imports in calendar 1997.</p>
<p>It did not give other details.</p>
<p>--Ercan Ersoy, Ankara newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
